[ 2026-10-06 19:18:49,543 ] groq._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/openai/v1/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-d37a1380-ffda-45a2-b1d4-3847d01a02ac', 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': 'You are a mechanical engineering output formatter.\nAnalyze the conversation history, tool calls, and results.\n\nParameters: {\'mass\': 200.0, \'acceleration\': 1.2, \'radius\': 0.1, \'gravity\': 9.81}\nUnits: {\'mass\': \'kg\', \'acceleration\': \'m/s^2\', \'radius\': \'m\', \'gravity\': \'m/s^2\'}\nOperations: [\'force\', \'torque\']\n\nReturn a valid JSON object matching this schema EXACTLY:\n{\n  "selected_tool": ["tool_name"],\n  "calculation_result": {"parameter_name": value},\n  "validation_result": {"valid": true/false, "warnings": ["warning1", "warning2"]},\n  "explanation": "Brief step-by-step summary of formulas and calculations."\n}\n\nIMPORTANT rules for \'validation_result\':\n- Set \'valid\' to true if the calculation executed correctly, false if there were errors.\n- The \'warnings\' list must NEVER be empty. Always include at least one warning.\nKeep \'explanation\' concise to ensure valid JSON generation.'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'A winch system lifts a mass $m = 200\\text{ kg}$ vertically with an acceleration $a = 1.2\\text{ m/s}^2$. The winch drum has a radius $r = 0.1\\text{ m}$. (Take $g = 9.81\\text{ m/s}^2$). Calculate the total lifting force ($F$) and the torque ($\\tau$) applied to the drum shaft.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': None, 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'fc_0a61b9b8-ffa4-4a15-81ec-3f37a429c866', 'function': {'name': 'calculate_force', 'arguments': '{"acceleration": 11.01, "mass": 200}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '2202.0', 'tool_call_id': 'fc_0a61b9b8-ffa4-4a15-81ec-3f37a429c866'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': None, 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'fc_b058ccfc-ef86-4fad-9e36-a7bfc7722581', 'function': {'name': 'calculate_torque', 'arguments': '{"force": 2202, "lever_arm": 0.1}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '220.20000000000002', 'tool_call_id': 'fc_b058ccfc-ef86-4fad-9e36-a7bfc7722581'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '**Total lifting force**\n\nThe winch must overcome the weight of the mass and provide the required upward acceleration:\n\n\\[\nF = m\\,(g + a)= 200\\;\\text{kg}\\;(9.81 + 1.20)\\;\\text{m/s}^2\n   = 200 \\times 11.01\\;\\text{N}\n   = \\boxed{2.20 \\times 10^{3}\\ \\text{N}}\n\\]\n\n**Torque on the drum shaft**\n\nThe torque is the product of the force and the drum radius (the force acts tangentially, i.e., at 90°):\n\n\\[\n\\tau = r\\,F = 0.10\\;\\text{m} \\times 2202\\;\\text{N}\n      = \\boxed{2.20 \\times 10^{2}\\ \\text{N·m}}\n\\]\n\nSo the winch must supply a lifting force of **≈\u202f2.20\u202fkN** and a shaft torque of **≈\u202f220\u202fN·m**.'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7}}
